Upstream-Name: mozc-character-pad
Source: Extracted from https://github.com/google/mozc at commit
 afb03ddfe72dde4cf2409863a3bfea160f7a66d8 (2018-02-26), the last revision
 before the character_palette and hand_writing GUI tools were removed
 upstream in commit a1dcadabd3a1c604e8beff1e45830c1d9adfce84 (2020-08-22).
 The mozc_server IPC client was subsequently removed from these sources
 (selecting a character now copies it to the clipboard instead), and the
 build system was replaced with CMake; see README.md for the full list of
 changes from upstream mozc.

